;; NORDVOW.COM - ADIM 2: Alan adini CloudFront'a yonlendirme
;; SADECE sertifika "Issued" olduktan ve CloudFront'a baglandiktan sonra yukleyin.
;; Cloudflare > DNS > Import and Export > Import DNS records
;; Baslangic icin Proxy "DNS only" (gri bulut) onerilir.
;;
;; NOT: Kok alan (nordvow.com) icin CNAME; bazi import araclari kok CNAME'i
;; reddedebilir. Reddederse kok kaydi elle ekleyin:
;;   Type=CNAME, Name=@, Target=d226kw9nfbh4rs.cloudfront.net
nordvow.com.     300 IN CNAME d226kw9nfbh4rs.cloudfront.net.
www.nordvow.com. 300 IN CNAME d226kw9nfbh4rs.cloudfront.net.
